<title>USA: Wells opens Oregon, Wash. in-store branches.</title>
<headline>Wells opens Oregon, Wash. in-store branches.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wells Fargo and Co and Safeway Inc said it is opening 11 in-store bank branches this year in Washington Safeway stores, 25 in Arizona and 50 in Oregon.</p>
<p>Earlier, the companies reported they would open 36 new in-store branches this year in California.</p>
<p>Wells Fargo has opened 76 branches inside Safeway stores in California since 1990.</p>
</text>
